        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The third popular detective adventure!\nIt is a detective adventure game where you can easily feel like a detective like reading a novel. Following the first \"Shiosai Edition\" on Kamakura and the second Kansai \"Twilight Edition\", the third \"Yujuku Hen\" will be set in Kagoshima, Kyushu. The player becomes the main character, a young editor \"Izumi\", and deduce the culprit based on the situation at the crime scene and the information collected in the interview. This \"Yujuku Edition\" is also actually on location in Kagoshima, and it is a full-fledged game composition.\n\nOriginally released in 2003 for Japanese mobile phones, it was later rereleased in 2007 as a \"Deluxe Edition\" with updated graphics.",
